**
!.dockerignore
!Dockerfile.agent
!Dockerfile.server
!Dockerfile.web
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!cmd/**
!internal/
!internal/**
!web/
!web/**

# Build inputs never need generated artifacts, dependencies, tests, local
# configuration, deployment output, or private key material. Keeping the
# context as an allowlist also prevents unrelated untracked files from being
# uploaded to a local or remote BuildKit daemon.
**/*_test.go
web/src/*.test.ts
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.npmrc
**/.yarnrc*
**/.pnpmrc
**/.netrc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
